The files in this directory come from two sources.

voc.txt and paper_output.txt are porter/voc.txt and porter/output.txt from
the Snowball project's test data (https://github.com/snowballstem/snowball-data,
commit 019921c). paper_output.txt is the output of the Porter stemmer
exactly as published in 1980. They are distributed under this licence:

